sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as CLI or TUI
    participant App as SfumatoApplication
    participant Page as GeneratePage
    participant Assets as ProjectAssetCatalog
    participant Image as Image provider
    participant Prompts as PromptCatalog
    participant Plugins as PagePluginCatalog
    participant Draft as Text provider
    participant Review as Reviewer provider
    participant Assemble as PageAssembler
    participant Math as Bundled MathJax
    participant Browser as PageInspector
    participant Store as ArtifactStore
    participant Publish as WorkspaceFileSystem

    User->>UI: generate page --instruction ... --plugin ...
    UI->>App: GeneratePageCommand
    App->>Page: effective config and outbound ports
    Page->>Plugins: resolve and verify selected runtimes
    Page->>Assets: resolve exact-theme then wildcard variants
    opt missing themed variant has a regeneration recipe
        Page->>Prompts: render artifact regeneration prompt
        Page->>Image: generate variant with active theme tokens
        Page->>Assets: cache content-addressed themed variant
    end
    Page->>Prompts: render page draft templates
    Page->>Draft: structured draft plus bounded tools
    Draft-->>Page: title, body_html, css, javascript
    Page->>Assemble: parse and statically validate fragments
    opt body contains TeX delimiters
        Assemble->>Math: verify and embed pinned tex-svg runtime
        Math-->>Assemble: runtime version and SHA-256 provenance
    end
    opt semantic review enabled
        Page->>Review: revision snapshot and sources
        Review-->>Page: RFC 6902 patch
        Page->>Assemble: validate patched document
    end
    Page->>Assemble: inspection document with offline CSP
    Page->>Browser: await math and inspect desktop/mobile viewports
    opt issues and review enabled
        Page->>Review: snapshot and focused issue report
        Review-->>Page: constrained RFC 6902 patch
        Page->>Browser: measure candidate again
    end
    Page->>Assemble: retain only images referenced by the final page
    Page->>Store: commit immutable page revision
    opt output directory selected
        Page->>Publish: atomically publish _sfumato/pages/slug tree
    end
    Page-->>UI: paths, models, plugins, runtimes, review, prompts, warnings
